 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505477,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Your family shares the cooking duties in the home. You've agreed to prepare the meal every 5 days. The last time you prepared dinner was a Tuesday. What day of the week will it be after you've prepared the meals 20 more times?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>If you prepared the meal 20 more times and you do it every 5 days, then 100 days have passed.</p>\n<p>To find what day it is, you need to find 100 modulo 7.</p>\n<p>100 ÷ 7 = 14 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"7 \\times 14 = 98\"></span></p>\n<p>Subtract 98 from 100.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"100 – 98 = 2\"></span></p>\n<p>The remainder is 2.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 100 modulo 7.</p>\n<p>100 modulo 7 ≡ 2</p>\n<p>Two days after Tuesday is Thursday.</p>\n<p>It will be Thursday after you have prepared the meals 20 more times.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Thursday"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
